Package: tm.ttni
Title: Teal Module for Time-to-Next-Intervention and Related TTE Tables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    "Y.G.", "Ma",
    email = "ygma0292@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Provides an open-source teal module and a reusable table builder
    for Time to Next Intervention (TTNI) and related time-to-event endpoints.
    Kaplan-Meier summaries are produced with tern/rtables for both multi-arm
    (dose-level) and two-arm designs. Hazard ratio, Wald confidence interval,
    and log-rank p-value are calculated only when exactly two treatment arms
    are present. The builder can be called without launching Shiny.
